{"path":"container/array/rbegin","title":"std::array<T,N>::rbegin, std::array<T,N>::crbegin","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::array&lt;T,N&gt;::</span>rbegin, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::array&lt;T,N&gt;::</span>crbegin","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/array/rbegin","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a reverse iterator to the first element of the reversed array. It corresponds to the last element of the non-reversed array.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">reverse_iterator rbegin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_reverse_iterator rbegin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_reverse_iterator crbegin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a reverse iterator to the first element of the reversed <code>array</code>. It corresponds to the last element of the non-reversed <code>array</code>. If the <code>array</code> is empty, the returned iterator is equal to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array/rend\">rend()</a></span>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-image\">\n<p><img alt=\"range-rbegin-rend.svg\" src=\"/cppreference/images/3/39/range-rbegin-rend.svg\" width=\"589\" height=\"250\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Reverse iterator to the first element.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/reverse_iterator/base\">underlying iterator</a> of the returned reverse iterator is the <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array/end\">end iterator</a>. Hence the returned iterator is invalidated if and when the end iterator is invalidated.</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;array&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> data\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"st0\">\"▁\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"▂\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"▃\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"▄\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"▅\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"▆\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"▇\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"█\"</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> arr<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/copy\"><span class=\"kw1594\">std::<span class=\"me2\">copy</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>data.<span class=\"me1\">cbegin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, data.<span class=\"me1\">cend</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, arr.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Print 'arr' in direct order using [cbegin, cend):<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/for_each\"><span class=\"kw1580\">std::<span class=\"me2\">for_each</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>arr.<span class=\"me1\">cbegin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, arr.<span class=\"me1\">cend</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, print<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span><span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>Print 'arr' in reverse order using [crbegin, crend):<span class=\"es1\">\\t</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/for_each\"><span class=\"kw1580\">std::<span class=\"me2\">for_each</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>arr.<span class=\"me1\">crbegin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, arr.<span class=\"me1\">crend</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, print<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Print 'arr' in direct order using [cbegin, cend):        ▁ ▂ ▃ ▄ ▅ ▆ ▇ █\n&nbsp;\nPrint 'arr' in reverse order using [crbegin, crend):     █ ▇ ▆ ▅ ▄ ▃ ▂ ▁</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array/rend\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rend</span><span>crend</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a reverse iterator to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/rbegin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rbegin</span><span>crbegin</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(C++14)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a reverse iterator to the beginning of a container or array <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/array","title":"std::array"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::array<T,N>::rbegin, std::array<T,N>::crbegin","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Returns a reverse iterator to the first element of the reversed array."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Reverse iterator to the first element."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Notes","note":"The underlying iterator of the returned reverse iterator is the end iterator."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"rend, crend","note":"returns a reverse iterator to the end"},{"label":"rbegin, crbegin","note":"returns a reverse iterator to the beginning of a container or array"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++14","C++17"],"wordCount":232,"codeBlockCount":2}
